# The DSS plate solution of dss_all_terms_deg5 (every AMDX/AMDY term
# 1..13, degree-5 TPD form; synthetic) on a pixel grid reaching 6000 px
# outside the cutout (15 cm on the plate). wcslib's pixel->sky accepts
# every grid point, but its iterative sky->pixel inverse (dis.c disx2p, 30
# steps of a separable secant scheme) fails to converge (status 9) on the
# sky positions of some of the far corners, where Newton iteration does
# converge. This is the documented difference on transform.New: for
# those points hdr_golden_test.go (hdrS2PBeyondWcslib) requires our
# sky->pixel to give back the SOURCE pixel of wcslib's own pixel->sky,
# i.e. wcslib's forward direction is the truth; every other point must
# agree with wcslib as usual.
# TOL_PX 3e-9: next to where it stops converging, wcslib's own sky->pixel
# answer is up to 1.3e-9 px from the pixel its pixel->sky started from
# (measured; at (3000, -6000) we are 7e-11 px from it); the 1e-9 px
# default is below wcslib's error there.
TOL_PX 3e-9
NOTE DSS plate solution, all 13 terms, 6000 px outside the plate
GRID -6000 6000 9 -6000 6000 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 400
NAXIS2  = 300
CNPIX1  = 9120
CNPIX2  = 4410
XPIXELSZ= 25.28445
YPIXELSZ= 25.28445
PPO3    = 177500.0
PPO6    = 177500.0
PLTRAH  = 5
PLTRAM  = 34
PLTRAS  = 31.94
PLTDECSN= '-       '
PLTDECD = 22
PLTDECM = 0
PLTDECS = 52.2
AMDX1   = 6.7165566279E+01
AMDX2   = 1.8513587312E-02
AMDX3   = -4.3815032712E+01
AMDX4   = -1.2310232101E-05
AMDX5   = 1.5281391001E-05
AMDX6   = -2.2214129003E-05
AMDX7   = -3.8711002135E-04
AMDX8   = 2.4110110037E-06
AMDX9   = -6.1911008122E-08
AMDX10  = 2.2930028134E-06
AMDX11  = 1.1102030201E-07
AMDX12  = -1.0212017106E-08
AMDX13  = 2.7311018101E-09
AMDY1   = 6.7167031235E+01
AMDY2   = -2.0129061902E-02
AMDY3   = 2.1304011803E+01
AMDY4   = -1.6513018011E-05
AMDY5   = -2.1030413102E-05
AMDY6   = 9.1001323019E-06
AMDY7   = -4.1021120903E-04
AMDY8   = 2.3810231019E-06
AMDY9   = 4.4013011903E-08
AMDY10  = 2.2401230109E-06
AMDY11  = -2.0991230811E-08
AMDY12  = 1.2903014403E-08
AMDY13  = -3.1102041118E-09
